//! AAC decode throughput benchmark.
//!
//! Decodes a real AAC-LC ADTS clip (generated with `ffmpeg -f lavfi -i
//! "sine=..." -c:a aac -f adts`) frame-by-frame to measure PCM reconstruction
//! throughput. Mirrors `tpt-kinetix-h264/benches/decode_throughput.rs`.
//!
//! Run with `cargo bench -p tpt-kinetix-aac`.

